        "pageid": 75800560,
        "ns": 0,
        "title": "Bluey: The Videogame",
        "extract": "Bluey: The Videogame is a 2023 adventure video game developed by Artax Games and published by Outright Games.  It is based on the television series Bluey, and was released on 17 November 2023 for Nintendo Switch, PlayStation 4, PlayStation 5, Windows, Xbox One and Xbox Series X/S.\nThe game features a story wrapped around a compilation of minigames, the majority of them involving platforming in which players can collect various collectibles. All minigames are accessed through four different maps based on various locations of the show. The game also has an multiplayer option in which four players can play as the Heeler family.",
